{"generated_at":"2026-09-02T04:28:41.050840Z","scope":"week","paper_count":33,"topics":[{"name":"Other Selected Research","count":11},{"name":"Strong Gravitational Lensing","count":9},{"name":"Dust and ISM","count":8},{"name":"Multi-phase and Molecular Gas","count":5},{"name":"Galaxy Evolution","count":1}],"papers":[{"id":"2608.30079","canonical_id":"2608.30079","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Host Dependence and Line-of-Sight Effects on Galaxy-Galaxy Strong Lensing in Clusters","authors":["Cian Roche","Michael McDonald","Priyamvada Natarajan","Keren Sharon","Isaque Dutra","Massimo Meneghetti","Mark Vogelsberger"],"categories":["astro-ph.CO"],"summary":"本文重新审视了星系团中星系-星系强引力透镜（GGSL）事件的观测与模拟之间的差异，发现相关视线结构会增强透镜概率，暗物质-only模拟的透镜概率比流体模拟低一个数量级，且透镜概率与爱因斯坦半径呈θ_E²关系。虽然匹配质量和爱因斯坦半径后差异有所减小，但结果强烈依赖于视场定义，残余张力无法明确归因于天体物理或宇宙学。","date":"2026-09-01","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.30079","score":95,"stars":5,"tier":"must-read","mandatory":true,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55}],"must_read_reason":"strong gravitational lensing","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing"]},{"id":"2608.27577","canonical_id":"2608.27577","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Measuring Extragalactic Microlens Masses and Motions in Strongly Lensed Quasar Systems with Intensity Interferometry","authors":["Abigail Moran","Ken Van Tilburg"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA","astro-ph.CO","astro-ph.IM"],"summary":"本文提出利用时间分辨强度干涉测量结合通量比测光，对强引力透镜类星体进行观测，从而突破传统光变微引力透镜中源尺寸、微透镜质量和横向速度之间的简并，实现对河外星系中单个恒星质量致密天体质量和横向运动的直接测量。","date":"2026-08-31","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.27577","score":95,"stars":5,"tier":"must-read","mandatory":true,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55}],"must_read_reason":"strong gravitational lensing","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing"]},{"id":"2608.28765","canonical_id":"2608.28765","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Comment on `Measuring the Hubble Constant Using Strongly Lensed Gravitational Wave Signals'","authors":["Jason S. C. Poon","Otto A. Hannuksela"],"categories":["astro-ph.CO"],"summary":"本文是对Huang等人(JCAP08(2023)003)工作的质疑评论。Huang等人声称仅凭透镜红移就能从透镜引力波事件中约束哈勃常数，但本文指出这一结论有误，因为在缺乏源红移或爱因斯坦半径信息的情况下，哈勃常数实际上无法被测量。","date":"2026-09-01","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.28765","score":92,"stars":5,"tier":"must-read","mandatory":true,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55},{"label":"gravitational lens modelling","points":28}],"must_read_reason":"strong gravitational lensing","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing"]},{"id":"2608.28430","canonical_id":"2608.28430","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Follow-up of SN 2025wny V: Lens Modelling and Cosmography of a Strongly Lensed Superluminous Supernova at $z = 2.015$ using Space Data","authors":["Edvard Mörtsell","Joel Johansson","Ariel Goobar","Alice Townsend","Hannah C. Turner","Suhail Dhawan","Cameron Lemon","Peter Nugent","Thomas E. Collett","Stephen Thorp","Jacob Osman Hjortlund","Jakob Nordin","Lin Yan","Graham P. Smith","Christoffer Fremling"],"categories":["astro-ph.CO"],"summary":"本文对红移z=2.015的强透镜型超亮超新星SN 2025wny进行了透镜与宇宙学分析，利用HST和JWST成像构建双椭圆幂律质量分布加外部剪切模型，结合时间延迟测量得到H0=66.7^{+7.6}_{-6.3} km/s/Mpc（等温剖面）或70.8^{+8.2}_{-6.1} km/s/Mpc（斜率可变），与现有宇宙学测量基本一致。","date":"2026-08-31","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.28430","score":92,"stars":5,"tier":"must-read","mandatory":true,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55}],"must_read_reason":"strong gravitational lensing","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing"]},{"id":"2608.28427","canonical_id":"2608.28427","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Follow-up of SN 2025wny IV: Photometric Time-delay Measurements of a Strongly Lensed Superluminous Supernova","authors":["Alice Townsend","Suhail Dhawan","Erin E. Hayes","Maggie L. Li","Joel Johansson","Edvard Mörtsell","Ariel Goobar","Lin Yan","Charlotte Ward","Veena Krishnaraj","Steve Schulze","Jacob Osman Hjortlund","Yu-Jing Qin","Hannah C. Turner","Peter Massey","Jakob Nordin","Jule Augustin","Aleksandra Bochenek","Malte Busmann","Christoffer Fremling","Daniel Gruen","Xander J. Hall","K. -R. Hinds","Ezequiel J. Marchesini","Zoë McGrath","Conor M. B. Omand","Eliana Palazzi","Daniel A. Perley","Andrea Rossi","Killa Santer","Jesper Sollerman","Chiara Ventura","Jacob L. Wise","Tracy X. Chen","Steven L. Groom","Mansi M. Kasliwal","Josiah Purdum"],"categories":["astro-ph.CO"],"summary":"本文报告了首颗强透镜型Ⅰ超亮超新星SN 2025wny（红移z=2.015）的光度时间延迟测量，通过GausSN高斯过程回归模型从多设施grizJ波段光变曲线中推断出图像间的时间延迟，结合透镜模型测得H₀，展示了强透镜超新星作为独立宇宙学探针的潜力。","date":"2026-08-31","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.28427","score":92,"stars":5,"tier":"must-read","mandatory":true,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55},{"label":"gravitational lens modelling","points":28}],"must_read_reason":"strong gravitational lensing","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing"]},{"id":"2608.26331","canonical_id":"2608.26331","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"HOLISMOKES -- XVIII. Cosmology with strongly lensed type II supernovae: Effects of instrumental setups on $H_0$","authors":["J. Grupa","S. Taubenberger","S. H. Suyu","D. Sluse","S. Huber","C. Vogl"],"categories":["astro-ph.CO","astro-ph.IM"],"summary":"本文研究了低分辨率光谱对强引力透镜II型超新星（LSNe II）时间延迟测距法测定哈勃常数（H₀）精度的影响，发现时间延迟可无偏确定且不确定性低至1.3天，单个透镜超新星的H₀精度为7.5%-14.2%，约20个透镜超新星即可实现1%的H₀测定。","date":"2026-08-28","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.26331","score":92,"stars":5,"tier":"must-read","mandatory":true,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55}],"must_read_reason":"strong gravitational lensing","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing"]},{"id":"2608.28413","canonical_id":"2608.28413","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Follow-up of SN 2025wny I: Space-based Observations of the First Multiply-imaged Superluminous Supernova","authors":["Ariel Goobar","Joel Johansson","Edvard Mörtsell","Cameron Lemon","Steve Schulze","Suhail Dhawan","Alice Townsend","Maggie L. Li","Yu-Jing Qin","Lin Yan","Christoffer Fremling","Mansi M. Kasliwal","Peter Nugent","Graham P. Smith","Jesper Sollerman","Igor Andreoni","Nikki Arendse","Thomas E. Collett","Jakob Nordin","Jacob Osman Hjortlund","Daniel A. Perley","Mickael Rigault","Stephen Thorp","Jacob L. Wise"],"categories":["astro-ph.CO"],"summary":"本文介绍了SN 2025wny，这是首个被强引力透镜化的超亮I型超新星（SLSN-I），红移z=2.0151，被两个星系透镜成五重像。通过HST和JWST的联合观测，获取了精确的天体测量、多波段测光和光谱数据，为超新星性质研究、透镜建模和时间延迟宇宙学（测量H0）提供了观测基础。","date":"2026-08-31","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.28413","score":88,"stars":5,"tier":"recommended","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing"]},{"id":"2608.25982","canonical_id":"2608.25982","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"REBELS-25: multi-phase morphology and kinematics at z = 7.31","authors":["Lucie E. Rowland","Hiddo S. B. Algera","Jacqueline Hodge","Mauro Stefanon","Rychard Bouwens","Manuel Aravena","Lucy Astles","Karin Cescon","Elisabete da Cunha","Ilse de Looze","Andrea Ferrara","Rebecca Fisher","Yoshinobu Fudamoto","Thomas Herard-Demanche","Hanae Inami","Mahsa Kohandel","Lena Komarova","Andrés Laza Ramos","Themiya Nanayakkara","Katherine Ormerod","Andrea Pallottini","Siân Phillips","Sander Schouws","Piyush Sharda","Renske Smit","Paul van der Werf"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA","astro-ph.CO"],"summary":"本文对红移z=7.31的大质量恒星形成星系REBELS-25进行了亚千秒差距分辨率的空间分辨多波段研究，结合ALMA [O III]88μm、[C II]、尘埃连续谱和JWST/NIRSpec IFU光谱数据，发现其UV/光学形态呈团块状不规则，而远红外发射呈近指数盘状；遮蔽恒星形成占总恒星形成率的55%-98%；电离线和中性气体共享同一大尺度旋转结构且动力学上冷（V/σ分别为~11和4.5），支持该星系在再电离时代已拥有尘埃丰富、化学增丰且动力学冷的星际介质。","date":"2026-08-27","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.25982","score":88,"stars":5,"tier":"archive","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Dust and ISM","Galaxy Evolution"]},{"id":"2608.28416","canonical_id":"2608.28416","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Follow-up of SN 2025wny III: Spectroscopic Time-delay Measurements of a Strongly Gravitationally Lensed Superluminous Supernova","authors":["Joel Johansson","Edvard Mörtsell","Ariel Goobar","Steve Schulze","Maggie L. Li","Yu-Jing Qin","Lin Yan","Hannah C. Turner","Suhail Dhawan","Alice Townsend","Jakob Nordin","Aleksandra Bochenek","Malte Busmann","Kaustav K. Das","Christoffer Fremling","Lluis Galbany","Alexa C. Gordon","Daniel Gruen","Mansi M. Kasliwal","Chang Liu","Zoë McGrath","Christopher Martin","Peter Massey","Martijn S. S. L. Oei","Daniel A. Perley","Andrés I. Ponte Pérez","Francisco Prada","Nikolaus Z. Prusinski","Nabeel Rehemtulla","R. Michael Rich","Surya Shivaprasad","Jesper Sollerman","Jacob L. Wise"],"categories":["astro-ph.CO"],"summary":"本文报告了首个空间分辨的强引力透镜超亮超新星SN 2025wny（红移z=2.015）的光谱观测，利用高斯过程建模追踪光谱特征的时间演化，测量了多个像之间的时间延迟，并结合透镜模型给出了哈勃常数H0 = 70.2^{+8.2}_{-6.1} km/s/Mpc。","date":"2026-08-31","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.28416","score":85,"stars":4,"tier":"recommended","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55},{"label":"gravitational lens modelling","points":28}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing"]},{"id":"2608.27560","canonical_id":"2608.27560","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Resolved Dust in $z\\approx1$ Galaxies with JWST/MIRI MRS: Survey Description and First View on PAHs, Mid-IR Atomic Emission, and Warm H$_2$","authors":["Wuji Wang","Andreas L. Faisst","Thomas S. -Y. Lai","Kyle Finner","Jed McKinney","Andrew J. Battisti","Irene Shivaei","Leindert A. Boogaard","Daizhong Liu","Yu-Heng Lin","Lun-Jun Liu","Georgios Magdis","Vincenzo Mainieri","Alexander Rodriguez","John D. Silverman","Zhaoxuan Liu","Minju M. Lee","Ghassem Gozaliasl","Maximilien Franco"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"该研究利用JWST/MIRI MRS首次对8个z≈1星系中的PAH（多环芳香烃）和红外发射线进行高分辨率空间分辨观测，揭示了PAH的尺寸、电荷状态及空间分布特征，并发现AGN和合并星系中中性PAH比例更高，中心PAH颗粒更大且电离程度更低，初步揭示了PAH随宇宙演化的潜在趋势。","date":"2026-08-31","url":"https://a